{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33815","headline":"奉和鲁望渔具十五咏 鸣桹 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望渔具十五咏 鸣桹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尽日平湖上，鸣桹仍动桨。\n丁丁入波心，澄澈和清响。\n鹭听独寂寞，鱼惊昧来往。\n尽水无所逃，川中有钩党。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33815.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33815","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}